stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> AwaitingPlatform : AwaitPlatformCommit(text) composition emptied by the IME
    Idle --> SuppressingEcho : SuppressEchoOf(text) field committed or abandoned it
    AwaitingPlatform --> SuppressingEcho : SuppressEchoOf(text)
    AwaitingPlatform --> Idle : ShouldSwallow(char) any char passes, remember it as platform commit
    AwaitingPlatform --> Idle : Tick() after GraceUpdates, Flush returns owed text to insert
    AwaitingPlatform --> SuppressingEcho : TakeOwedNow() returns owed text, no replay registered
    AwaitingPlatform --> Idle : Flush() or Cancel()
    SuppressingEcho --> SuppressingEcho : ShouldSwallow(char) echo prefix so far, swallowed
    SuppressingEcho --> Idle : ShouldSwallow(char) whole echo matched, swallowed
    SuppressingEcho --> Idle : ShouldSwallow(char) mismatch, char passes
    SuppressingEcho --> SuppressingEcho : Tick() frozen while ReplayedComposition != null
    SuppressingEcho --> Idle : Tick() after GraceUpdates, or Flush(), or Cancel()
    Idle --> Idle : ShouldSwallow(char) IsThePlatformSayingItAgain
    note right of Idle
        Two registers live outside the mode and survive Reset:
        _replay (set by SuppressEchoOf/IgnoreReplayOf, cleared by a differing
        composition, NotePlatformReleased while Idle, or Forget)
        _platformCommit (set by ShouldSwallow in AwaitingPlatform, NotePlatformCommitted,
        Flush - cleared by AwaitPlatformCommit, NoteComposing on an unrelated
        composition, a non-matching char, ForgetPlatformCommit, Forget)
    end note
